  "description": "I've been possessed by a novel where the emperor, deprived of his beloved, becomes a war-crazed secondary male lead.\nAnd I'm just an extra princess in that nation swept away to ruin.\n\nTo survive and protect her beloved father and people,\nshe sought only one heir to inherit the mermaid bloodline's power...\nYet the man she spent the night with was that very mad emperor.\n\nHe feigned affection and obsession, then went one step further by treating her like a pregnant woman?\nWhere on earth does this confidence that she's instantly pregnant come from?\nPlease, just set me free!\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/64823992), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%ED%8F%AD%EA%B5%B0-%EC%84%9C%EB%B8%8C%EB%82%A8%EC%A3%BC%EC%9D%98-%EC%A7%91%EC%B0%A9%EC%9D%80-%ED%95%84%EC%9A%94-%EC%97%86%EC%8A%B5%EB%8B%88%EB%8B%A4/4191)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/174238)",
